<section class="home-caas-section">

    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-4 w-container">

        <div class="caas-header">
           <h2 class="crafting-heading caas-heading">
    <span class="caas-cap">C</span>ulture <span class="caas-cap">A</span>s <span class="caas-cap">A</span> <span class="caas-cap">S</span>ystem
</h2>

            <h3 class="caas-intro">
                We put a method to how destination marketing actually works
            </h3>

        </div>

        <div class="caas-flow">

            <article class="caas-step">
                <span class="caas-number">01</span>
                <h3>DECODE</h3>
                <p>
                    We identify rising subcultures and passion points in India across music, sport, fandom, wellness, food, etc. and spot what's making waves.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="caas-step">
                <span class="caas-number">02</span>
                <h3>MATCH</h3>
                <p>
                    We pair each passion point with a destination experience that authentically fits, and creators who already have real credibility in that subculture, not just a presence in it.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="caas-step">
                <span class="caas-number">03</span>
                <h3>NARRATE</h3>
                <p>
                    We craft the destination stories in the subculture's own language. The destination lives within the narrative, never bolted on top or as a backdrop.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="caas-step">
                <span class="caas-number">04</span>
                <h3>CONVERT</h3>
                <p>
                    We engineer the path from emotion to actual bookings using these stories with regional languages, the platforms audiences actually use, and trade activations.
                </p>
            </article>

        </div>

        <a class="button hero-download-btn w-inline-block" href="/contact">
         <div class="text-block-6">Get In Touch</div>
         <span class="hero-btn-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/destination-marketing-agency/images/arrow-top-right-purple.svg" width="12"/>
         </span>
        </a>

    </div>

</section>

