<section class="section-8" id="faq">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-10 w-container">
     <div class="w-layout-grid grid-16">
      <h2 class="heading-20" data-w-id="69f3e81b-e3ab-9564-a29d-1592c3d0da5f">FAQs</h2>
     </div>
     <div class="div-block-41 faq-list" id="faqList" data-faq-collapsed="true">

      <div class="accordian-item w-dropdown" data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="69f3e81b-e3ab-9564-a29d-1592c3d0da66">
       <div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle">
        <div class="accordian-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div>
        <h3 class="text-block-30">What does a travel marketing agency do?</h3>
       </div>
       <div class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list">
        <div class="text-block-34">
         A travel marketing agency turns a destination or travel brand into a choice travellers actively make. It maps the audience's cultural passions, builds a story inside them, casts the right creators, then engineers the path from that story to a booked trip. Success is measured in arrivals, not impressions.
        </div>
       </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordian-item w-dropdown" data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="69f3e81b-e3ab-9564-a29d-1592c3d0da70">
       <div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle">
        <div class="accordian-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div>
        <h3 class="text-block-30">How is a travel marketing agency different from a regular ad agency?</h3>
       </div>
       <div class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list">
        <div class="text-block-35">
         A regular ad agency buys media and hopes it lands. A travel marketing agency starts with why a destination matters to a specific audience, builds the story inside that culture, then engineers the path to a booked trip. The difference shows up in arrivals, not just impressions.
        </div>
       </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordian-item w-dropdown" data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="69f3e81b-e3ab-9564-a29d-1592c3d0da7a">
       <div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle">
        <div class="accordian-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div>
        <h3 class="text-block-30">Do travel marketing agencies work with national tourism boards?</h3>
       </div>
       <div class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list">
        <div class="text-block-36">
         Yes. Melange works directly with national tourism boards and destination marketing organisations, including Singapore Tourism Board, Hong Kong Tourism Board, and Saudi Tourism Authority to name a few. Our campaigns are built to survive board-level scrutiny: measurable arrivals, clear attribution, and outcomes a minister can report upward.
        </div>
       </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordian-item w-dropdown faq-item--extra" data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="69f3e81b-e3ab-9564-a29d-1592c3d0da84">
       <div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle">
        <div class="accordian-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div>
        <h3 class="text-block-30">What results can a destination expect from travel advertising?</h3>
       </div>
       <div class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list">
        <div class="text-block-37">
         Real travel advertising is measured in arrivals and bookings, not clicks or views. Melange's campaigns have driven double-digit YOY arrival growth and multi-million-dollar attributed sales for tourism boards and travel brands. Every campaign is built around a specific, trackable outcome agreed before work begins.
        </div>
       </div>
      </div>

      <div class="accordian-item w-dropdown faq-item--extra" data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="69f3e81b-e3ab-9564-a29d-1592c3d0da8e">
       <div class="accordion-toggle w-dropdown-toggle">
        <div class="accordian-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div>
        <h3 class="text-block-30">How much does it cost to work with a travel and tourism marketing agency?</h3>
       </div>
       <div class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list">
        <div class="text-block-38">
         Cost depends on the mandate: a single campaign, a market launch, or an ongoing retainer all price differently. Melange scopes every engagement around the board or brand's specific goals rather than a flat package. The fastest way to get a real number is a strategy call.
        </div>
       </div>
      </div>

      <button type="button" class="faq-more-btn" id="faqMoreBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqList">
       <span class="faq-more-btn__label">Show all questions</span>
       <span class="faq-more-btn__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </button>

     </div>
    </div>
   </section>

